        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-26T23:07:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint with Wraith at low single digit hp. Basically ignored the victims and played the damage race. Locked down Spite'spoils damage with a twist the etherialists and dropped a compulsion canister on him almost every turn.&nbsp;</p><p>Finished him off with a 20 point L<span>ightspeed Barrage .&nbsp;</span></p>",
