        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-29T18:52:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Spite isn't my favorite but for me he falls flat more on how victims are handled than anything else. &nbsp; I get why they are there but it seems like they are a pawn of the heroes and villain. &nbsp; In his base version you almost want to skip getting any into the safe house until he is about to flip and on in his variant you want them in there quick but once flipped you don't want to leave any in the safehouse. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
